Subject: [PATCH] wip(r3-dispatch): checkpoint arm sources

Committed by the batch sweep, not by the agent that wrote it. The scratchpad
lost ~half its built exes when C: hit 100%, so the source in this worktree is
the only surviving copy of this arm. Branch hunt/r3-dispatch.

files: 3rd/toridraw/toridraw_raster.u.c
